<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sallie Mae started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sallie Mae started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities initiated coverage of Student Loan Marketing Association as a hold, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Student Loan Marketing Association, or Sallie Mae, lost 1/8 to 118-1/4.</p>
</text>
